  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kelaniya 07-08</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kelaniya 07-08</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att bygga forskningskapacitet inom  samh&#xe4;llsvetenskap vid universitetet i Kelaniya. 6 doktorander har registrerats och skall under projektets g&#xe5;ng doktorera inom omr&#xe5;det regional utveckling med fokus p&#xe5; sambandet mellan fattigdom och utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to unravel factors influencing regional and local differences in Sri Lanka. Focus is placed on the relationship between development,poverty and exclusion. Using a database on regional development, the processes of change in the neoliberal economy is analyzed. The roles and perspectives of the local stakeholders including the impact of the Tsunami disaster will be studied.</narrative>
  </description>
